<p>Pay 10% of your current life and gain 100% darkness damage conversion for 1 turns.</p><p>If Dark Reign is active you also gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 15, 20, 25</acronym> stamina and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 15, 20, 25</acronym> vim per stack.</p>